# Compiled executables (build them with `make`) have no extension, so they
# cannot be matched by name. Instead, ignore everything and re-include only
# what belongs in the repository: directories, sources, docs, images and text data.
# New program directories need no extra lines.
*
!*/
!*.c
!*.h
!*.md
!*.png
!*.txt
!Makefile
!.gitignore

# Editor files (includes the large IntelliSense database)
.vscode/
